Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:02.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your dabeli once cost just six
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.73,0:00:03.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,paise!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.74,0:00:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the 1960s, in Mandvi, Kutch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.18,0:00:08.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kesha Malam is said to have made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.69,0:00:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The recipe is in the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:14.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dabeli means pressed: masala
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:16.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,pressed into pav.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mandvi's dabeli masala is still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:20.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,considered the most authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:23.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that shop? Still open today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:24.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,run by his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:27.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Had a dabeli in Mandvi? Tell us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.27,0:00:28.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the comments.
